{"id":"n60585-1-7","stage":3,"title":"빨개지다 · 发红","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60585-1-7-1","ko":"너 저 애 좋아하지? 부끄러워서 얼굴이 빨개졌는데?","zh":"你喜欢那孩子吧？你都害羞得脸红了哦？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"애","meaning":"孩子，小孩","explanation":"애：孩子，小孩","readings":[{"term":"애","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73967","senseId":"1","lemma":"애","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"애","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아하지?","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아하지","audio":"/audio/41e6571d1f4015d27f20.mp3"}},{"text":"부끄러워서","meaning":"害羞，羞涩，腼腆","explanation":"부끄럽다：害羞，羞涩，腼腆；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"부끄럽다","audio":"/audio/3109572de7c050e1c422.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60125","senseId":"1","lemma":"부끄럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부끄러워서","audio":"/audio/ed81675ff8e1a8b54d38.mp3"}},{"text":"얼굴이","meaning":"脸，面孔，脸部","explanation":"얼굴：脸，面孔，脸部；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼굴이","audio":"/audio/81669bb10178aa2a65c6.mp3"}},{"text":"빨개졌는데?","meaning":"发红，变红","explanation":"빨개지다：发红，变红；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"빨개지다","audio":"/audio/18f6f8f7c06753250985.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60585","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨개지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨개졌는데","audio":"/audio/b843ed19d32ff67d7a1d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"a9fee06ad11f5bbd","term":"애","zh":"孩子，小孩","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3","entryId":"73967","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["애ː"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"对某事抱有好感。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]},{"id":"3109572de7c050e1","term":"부끄럽다","zh":"害羞，羞涩，腼腆","audio":"/audio/3109572de7c050e1c422.mp3","entryId":"60125","definition":"感到不好意思或难为情。","pronunciation":["부끄럽따"]},{"id":"886ae927b512e2e4","term":"얼굴","zh":"脸，面孔，脸部","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3","entryId":"17183","definition":"有眼睛、鼻子、嘴的头的前面部分。","pronunciation":["얼굴"]},{"id":"18f6f8f7c0675325","term":"빨개지다","zh":"发红，变红","audio":"/audio/18f6f8f7c06753250985.mp3","entryId":"60585","definition":"色泽变成红色。","pronunciation":["빨ː개지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/12a8baedbb7e3c5a647f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60585-1-7-2","ko":"아니야. 그냥 갑자기 추워서 그런 거야.","zh":"不是的。只是突然觉得冷而已。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니야.","meaning":"不是，不对","explanation":"아니야：不是，不对","readings":[{"term":"아니야","audio":"/audio/b8a273e5d75f1fd1734c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29726","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니야","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surf